<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans rose in Sept 25 wk.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans rose in Sept 25 wk.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED SEPTEMBER 25</p>
<p> U.S. business Loans.......367,629 up.....1,635</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances.....365,869 up.....1,588</p>
<p> Govt, agency securities...268,917 down...1,432</p>
<p> Trading account ...........20,573 down.....215</p>
<p> CDs, major time deposits..140,140 up.......624</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....748,171 down...8,416</p>
<p> Financial companies.......551,917 down...4,054</p>
<p> New York business loans....42,260 down.....151</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......42,010 down.....157</p>
<p> CDs/major time deposits... 23,573 down.....739</p>
